  "description": "Ninka .NET runtime — evaluates authorization policies compiled by ninka-authz (Tegata → deterministic Rego/WASM) in-process. No network, no policy server; the only dependency is the pinned Wasmtime engine. Supports artifact_format_version 1; verified against the pinned OPA 0.65.0 toolchain and the shared validation-vector corpus. Check() is thread-safe (evaluations are serialized per policy). Failure contract: a policy's refusal is false; unparseable input JSON, unknown policy ids, artifact integrity failures and WASM traps are exceptions — no failure mode ever returns allow.",
